  "readme": "# `@anyshift/backstage-plugin-anyshift-backend`\n\nBackend-system plugin that keeps Anyshift credentials server-side, uses `@anyshift/graph-sdk` for\nGraph API transport, and enforces `anyshift.view` and `anyshift.query` on HTTP routes.\n\n```ts\nbackend.add(import('@anyshift/backstage-plugin-anyshift-backend'));\n```\n\nThe query endpoint is disabled by default and is not mounted until `anyshift.query.enabled` is\ntrue. See the [integration guide](../../README.md) for configuration and permission policy details.\n",
